</span></td>
<td id="S5.T4.5.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S5.T4.5.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:284.5pt;">
